{
  "bookId": "hero-213017",
  "id": "bond-33402",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "33402001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蔡文姬",
          "text": "刚才这首曲子，主君感觉如何？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "33402003",
              "text": "感觉有些奇怪"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "33402003",
              "text": "感觉有些微妙"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "33402002",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "33402003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蔡文姬",
          "text": "不愧是主君，只听一遍就发现了曲中的异样。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "33402004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蔡文姬",
          "text": "我尝试了十多种乐器的组合，可始终没有满意的结果。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "33402005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蔡文姬",
          "text": "已经过去了这么长时间。究竟是哪里出了问题……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "33402006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "哪怕是天才也有找不到灵感的时候。休息一下如何？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "33402007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蔡文姬",
          "text": "一刻没有完成，我就一刻放不下心。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "33402008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "这首曲子有这么重要吗？它是写给谁的？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "33402009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蔡文姬",
          "text": "此曲当然是献给我最重要的知己，也就是主君您的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "33402010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "居然是这样。看来我必须得帮忙了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "33402011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蔡文姬",
          "text": "只要主君在身边，我就感觉思若泉涌呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "33402012",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "一段时间后……",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "33402013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蔡文姬",
          "text": "这样一来，这一部分就完成了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "33402014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蔡文姬",
          "text": "主君寥寥数语，就令乐曲有所进展。\n主君正是我的灵感之源呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "33402015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "能帮上忙就好。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "33402016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蔡文姬",
          "text": "但曲中未竟之处还有许多。\n为了完成乐曲，还请主君一直留在我的身边哦。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
